# Workflow

## Before changes

1. Read active rules and relevant docs.
2. Inspect `package.json` and existing patterns (when present).
3. State a short plan, files to touch, and readiness criteria.

## During changes

- Touch only relevant files; no drive-by refactors.
- No new dependencies without necessity; UI deps require `pick-ui-library`.
- No `any` without justification; do not disable lint; do not hide type errors.
- Do not replace critical logic with TODO.

## After changes

1. Run required checks for the phase.
2. Fix failures.
3. Review the diff.
4. Manual check of changed surfaces.
5. Apply a review skill if motion/UI craft applies.
6. Write the report, then stop if the phase is complete.

## Required report format

```text
Что реализовано
Какие файлы изменены
Какие архитектурные решения приняты
Какие проверки выполнены
Результаты проверок
Известные ограничения
Что не входило в задачу
```

## Phase 0 note

Bootstrap has no typecheck/lint/test/build until Phase 1 introduces the app. Document verification commands for later phases instead of inventing a fake toolchain.
